<title>HONG KONG: Meilin gains sharply in early morning.</title>
<headline>Meilin gains sharply in early morning.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hefei Meilin Co Ltd made a robust trading debut on Wednesday morning.</p>
<p>The Anhui-based refrigerator maker opened at HK$3.80 and promptly rose to HK$3.65. This compared with its recent offer price of HK$3.07 per share.</p>
<p>The issue hit a high of HK$3.96 and low of 3.60 on a volume of 5.55 million shares.</p>
<p>Brokers said Meilin's debut was aided by its solid profits record and said they expect the counter to gain at least 15 percent today. The company listed 100 million class B shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
